    <briefdescription>
<para>Computes a <computeroutput><ref refid="structthemis_1_1toolbox_1_1_content_fingerprint" kindref="compound">ContentFingerprint</ref></computeroutput> from raw bytes or UTF-8 text. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Internally uses OpenSSL <computeroutput>SHA256()</computeroutput> for the cryptographic digest. Token estimation uses the same 4 chars-per-token heuristic as <computeroutput>rag::DocumentSplitter</computeroutput>.</para>
<para>Thread-safety: all methods are stateless; an instance may be shared across threads. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
